            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 78425,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's the counter variable named in this code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  i += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">There's no counter variable in the code</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You rename the counter variable from <code>i</code> to <code>step</code>. Which change keeps this loop working the same way?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  i += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Replace <code>i</code> with <code>step</code> everywhere it appears.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Replace <code>i</code> only in the first line.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Replace <code>i</code> only in the condition and update.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Replace <code>i</code> with <code>step</code> everywhere it appears.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Code: Counter variable",
            "id": 78990,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use the <code>counter</code> variable to set the condition to less than <code>11</code> .</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating payroll&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>while</code> followed by <code>counter</code> and then <code>&lt;</code>, <code>11</code>, <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Make <code>Updating payroll</code> print exactly eight times, then stop. Put <code>counter</code> on the left of the comparison.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating payroll&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>while</code>, followed by <code>counter</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>11</code>, and finally <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing the counter",
            "id": 78415,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(counter)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>As written, this code displays <code>2</code>. Which single change would make it display <code>4</code> instead?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(counter)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Change the condition to <code>counter &lt; 4</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Change <code>counter += 1</code> to <code>counter += 4</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Change <code>counter = 1</code> to <code>counter = 0</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Change the condition to <code>counter &lt; 4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Changing the counter variable",
            "id": 78417,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The numbers <code>0</code> , <code>1</code> and <code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The numbers <code>1</code>, <code>2</code>, and<code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The numbers <code>0</code>, <code>1</code>, <code>2</code>, and<code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The numbers <code>0</code> , <code>1</code> and <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>As written, this loop displays <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> and <code>2</code>, as the console shows. What would it do if you deleted the line <code>counter += 1</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It would display <code>0</code> over and over without stopping.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It would display <code>0</code> once and then stop.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It would still display <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> and <code>2</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It would display <code>0</code> over and over without stopping.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Condition",
            "id": 78419,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Display the number <code>1</code> through <code>3</code> by setting the condition to <code>number &lt;= 3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(number)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  number += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Print <code>1</code> through <code>3</code>, including <code>3</code> itself. Choose the operator that keeps looping up to and including <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(number)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  number += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Incrementing",
            "id": 79150,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inside the <code>for</code> loop's code block, add <code>~</code> to the <code>line</code> variable by using the <code>+=</code> operator.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;*&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += \" /><text value=\"&quot;~&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(line)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"51\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"*\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~~\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>+=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: i counter",
            "id": 79145,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which variable is the counter variable of the <code>for</code> loop?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += i\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(line)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>line</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>in</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>At the end of the third repetition, what values do <code>i</code> and <code>line</code> hold?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += i\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(line)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code> is <code>2</code> and <code>line</code> is <code>3</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code> is <code>3</code> and <code>line</code> is <code>3</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code> is <code>2</code> and <code>line</code> is <code>2</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i</code> is <code>2</code> and <code>line</code> is <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 79144,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's the name of the counter variable in this code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Zero to four:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" repetition \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(repetition)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Zero to four:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>repetition</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Zero to  five:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>repetition</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The console below shows what this code displays as it stands.</p><p>Now suppose the loop header were <code>for step in range(5):</code> but the display line still used <code>repetition</code>. What would Python do?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Zero to four:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" repetition \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(repetition)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Zero to four:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Python reports an error because <code>repetition</code> is no longer the counter's name.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The loop still displays the numbers from <code>0</code> through <code>4</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The loop displays the word <code>step</code> five times.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Python reports an error because <code>repetition</code> is no longer the counter's name.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: For keyword",
            "id": 79152,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Polly wants a cracker!</code> three times</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The numbers <code>1</code> through <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The numbers <code>0</code> through <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Polly wants a cracker!</code> three times.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The loop below repeats three times. What value does <code>i</code> hold during the third and last repetition?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nothing, because the loop body never uses <code>i</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
